**DIRAC                                                                                             
.TITLE                                                                                              
  MgF electric field -> dipole                                                                      
.WAVE F                                                                                             
.4INDEX                                                                                             
.PROPERTIES                                                                                         
#.ANALYZE                                                                                           
**INTEGRALS                                                                                         
.NUCMOD                                                                                             
2                                                                                                   
*READIN                                                                                             
.UNCONTRACTED                                                                                       
